434 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 1553 0 R
/T (Missing Value Imputation: Based on the EDA insights, various imputation 	methods were evaluated, including MICE \(Multiple Imputation by Chained Equa-	tions\), Forward Fill, and MCMC \(Markov Chain Monte Carlo\) algorithms.  The 	MCMC algorithm was found to be most effective in capturing complex inter-feature 	relationships.)
/E (Missing Value Imputation: Based on the EDA insights, various imputation 	methods were evaluated, including MICE \(Multiple Imputation by Chained Equa-	tions\), Forward Fill, and MCMC \(Markov Chain Monte Carlo\) algorithms.  The 	MCMC algorithm was found to be most effective in capturing complex inter-feature 	relationships.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
