/E (Benefits in High Class Imbalance Scenarios:  In binary classification problems with high class imbalance, such as in many financial applications \(e.g., fraud detection, credit scoring\), the majority class can dominate the decision boundary, causing the model to underperform on the minority class. By incorporating a logit shift:)
