<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 1636 0 R
/T (Adjusting Sensitivity and Specificity: The shift c allows the model to modify its threshold for classifying an instance as a positive or negative. This is particularly useful when the cost of false negatives is high, as often seen in finance where missing a fraudulent transaction or default can be costly.  By carefully tuning c, one can increase sensitivity \(true positive rate\) without a substantial sacrifice in specificity.)
/E (Adjusting Sensitivity and Specificity: The shift c allows the model to modify its threshold for classifying an instance as a positive or negative. This is particularly useful when the cost of false negatives is high, as often seen in finance where missing a fraudulent transaction or default can be costly.  By carefully tuning c, one can increase sensitivity \(true positive rate\) without a substantial sacrifice in specificity.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [20]
>>
