/E (While both methods can improve model performance, the Voting Classifier is often pre-ferred for its simplicity, interpretability, and robustness to overfitting. It tends to gener-alize well, especially when the base models are already strong performers. The Stacking Estimator, while potentially more powerful, introduces additional complexity and may be more prone to overfitting if not carefully tuned.)
/Pg 31 0 R
