3313 0 obj
<<
/Title (Model Development: An ensemble of gradient boosting models, including XG-	Boost, LightGBM, and CatBoost, was implemented.  Hyperparameter tuning was 	performed to optimize model performance. The ensemble was evaluated on the test 	dataset using 100-fold cross-validation to ensure robust model training and assess-	ment.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 3311 0 R
/Next 3315 0 R
>>
