3315 0 obj
<<
/Title (Performance Metric Selection:  Given the critical nature of tax compliance 	detection, the model was optimized for high sensitivity.  The recall metric was 	prioritized to minimize Type II errors \(false negatives\), ensuring a high rate of 	fraud detection.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 3313 0 R
/Next 3317 0 R
>>
